Ward {2}
Wanderer's Scourge can't be blocked by more than one creature.
{2}{G}, Discard Wanderer's Scourge: Search your library for a basic Forest card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.

Whenever a creature card is put into your graveyard from anywhere, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control with lesser power than that card.
Cycling {1}{G}
When you cycle Viridas Scavenger, mill three cards.
